  <li class="device-guide__step"><span class="device-guide__tile"><span class="app-icon app-icon--square-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="device-guide__text">Choose <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>, then tap <strong>Add</strong>.</span></li>
  <li class="device-guide__step"><span class="device-guide__tile"><span class="app-icon app-icon--bell" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="device-guide__text">Open Pinalert from your Home Screen. In Settings, turn on <strong>On this device</strong>.</span></li>
